# Vendored Pokédex images — client/public/sprites (1 MB PNG) and client/public/artwork
# (16 MB AVIF), both regenerated by server/src/sync/vendorSprites.mjs.
#
# Committed deliberately rather than ignored: they ship inside the APK, PokéAPI asks callers to
# cache rather than fetch per view, and a build that silently skipped the vendor step would ship
# 404s — artworkUrl is a real-looking path, so nothing falls back. Add an ignore rule here if
# you would rather fetch them at build time, and add a build-time check with it.

# Vendored trading card art — 20,394 files, ~317 MB, from server/src/sync/vendorCards.mjs.
# NOT committed, unlike the Pokédex sets above. Play caps a base module at 200 MB, so this
# cannot ship that way whatever git does, and 317 MB is permanent once it enters history.
# Regenerate with: node server/src/sync/vendorCards.mjs  (resumable; it skips what it has)
client/public/cards/
